            "height": 80.0,
            "color": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "note_3",
            "text": "**Pad**: slow 400ms attack, high sustain (0.8), long release \u2192 swelling, ambient tone",
            "x": 180.0,
            "y": 200.0,
            "width": 230.0,
            "height": 80.0,
            "color": 1
        },
        {
            "id": "note_4",
            "text": "**Perc**: instant attack, very fast decay (80ms), short release \u2192 snappy click",
